Z||000003||batboy||01-15-2000||08:39 AM||||I've heard good stuff about the Transgo shift kits. I'm going to probably put one in the Batmobile. Here is what the Transgo ad says:<P>THM 125 <BR>1980 up <BR>Corrects/prevents/Reduces: <BR>3-2 clunk; lockup shudder; reverse slip; converter drain back delay; <BR>late shifts; soft 1-2; band failure.<P> <A HREF="http://www.teleport.com./~txchange/sk.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.teleport.com./~txchange/sk.htm</A> <BR>||||reg||1
